caption: Rank Tests

There is, of course, an actual test involved, but don’t worry, it is super easy at low Ranks! All rank up tests include five categories: Close Combat, Ranged Combat, Tactics, Technical Expertise, and Vehicle Operation. You are also judged on Customer Service, but that is just part of completing the ranked missions! (see our pay scale below; shhhh, it’s a secret). For details about testing for a particular rank, please ask your mission handler!
